    "description": {
      "value": "<p>A zone of goodwill radiates from you in a 60-foot Emanation for the duration. When you make an ability check to influence a creature in that area, you can treat a d20 roll of 9 or lower as a 10.</p><section class=\"secret\" id=\"secret-uZtqLJ6huCHgckc7\"><p><strong>Foundry Note</strong></p><p>The effect sets a minimum of 10 on the d20 of your Animal Handling, Deception, Intimidation, Performance and Persuasion checks; it only applies to influencing creatures in the zone.</p></section>",
